# Data & state

## Redux

- Slice definitions live in `src/store/`; register reducers in `src/store/store.ts`
- Dispatch typed actions from hooks (e.g. `useWeeklyTasks`) rather than scattering fetch logic in components
- Select state with `RootState` from `@/store/store`

## Weekly tasks

- Business logic: `WeeklyTasksService`, sync via `weeklyTasksSyncService`, reset/snapshot via `snapShotService`
- Persistence: strategy pattern under `src/lib/storage/weeklyTasks/` (local vs Supabase)—extend strategies instead of bypassing them

## Supabase & secrets

- Browser: `@/lib/supabase/client.ts`
- Server-only privileged access: server actions with env vars (`SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` never in client components)
- Do not commit `.env` or hardcode keys

## Types

- Shared domain types in `src/types/`; feature-specific types under `src/features/<name>/types/`
- Reuse `WeeklyTask` and related shapes from `@/types` instead of duplicating interfaces

## API routes

- Route handlers under `src/app/api/` — keep handlers thin; delegate to services
